    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "By default, `AVCaptureStillImageOutput` emits images with the same dimensions as its source [`AVCaptureDevice`](avcapturedevice.md) instance’s `activeFormat.formatDescription`.",
      "ko": "기본적으로 `AVCaptureStillImageOutput`은 소스 [`AVCaptureDevice`](avcapturedevice.md) 인스턴스의 `activeFormat.formatDescription`과 동일한 치수의 이미지를 방출합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "3c080a1431c5b1a571a3e3303a102c4b23691eeaa6fa40afbe1221cd1cfbcb35",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "However, if you set this property to [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true), the receiver emits still images at the capture device’s [`highResolutionStillImageDimensions`](avcapturedevice/format/highresolutionstillimagedimensions.md) value.",
      "ko": "그러나 이 값을 [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true)로 설정하면 수신기가 캡처 장치의 [`highResolutionStillImageDimensions`](avcapturedevice/format/highresolutionstillimagedimensions.md) 값으로 정지 이미지를 방출합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "babdc108725359238f2902abb0f0933e00ac7969ad5436db719ed70ecccf3d84",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:blockquote:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "**Note**: If you enable video stabilization by setting `preferredVideoStabilizationMode` to [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true) for any output, the high resolution still images emitted by `AVCaptureStillImageOutput` may be smaller by 10% or more.",
      "ko": "**참고**: `preferredVideoStabilizationMode`를 [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true)로 설정해 어느 출력이든 동영상 안정화를 사용하도록 하면 `AVCaptureStillImageOutput`이 방출하는 고해상도 정지 이미지가 10% 이상 작아질 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "ea4f5de33e12d6b2dff9300608f9942ee2c3fd954937f16b9aa6733962fb458b",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
